"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTE4NTIxMjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20work","name":"needs work","color":"cc9999","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-03T17:49:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T01:49:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: `4.8-dev4_mono`\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8266) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9700 CPU @ 3.00GHz (8 threads) - 15.93 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOccasionally, when I'm using CSG nodes, I will find that the handles to resize no longer appear. Selecting a different CSG node does not fix it. Reloading the scene does not fix it. Hiding/showing gizmos does not fix it.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1032\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90b18e26-6aea-4174-9e5c-c7beca03b8d8\" />\n\nThe only fix I know is to reload the project. Then the handles re-appear:\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1032\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a43ebc7b-b441-45e7-9d31-75c79db9ebeb\" />\n\nI previously thought this was the same as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106078, since switching from Direct3D 12 to Vulkan fixed it, but that was actually not the case. Reloading the project after changing the renderer is what fixed it. The above screenshots were taken using the Vulkan renderer.\n\nWhich means I can confirm this issue happens for both Direct3D 12 and Vulkan (Windows).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHappens randomly when using CSG nodes, so I don't have reliable steps to reproduce.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nUnsure of the cause of the issue, so I can't create an MRP.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123146/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123146/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}